    "rawHtml": "<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-normal text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl md:text-5xl md:leading-none\">\r\n        <span class=\"block\">Focus on creative</span>\r\n    </h1>\r\n    <p\r\n        class=\"max-w-sm mx-auto mt-1 font-normal text-gray-500 text- sm:mt-5 sm:text-md md:mt-5 md:text-xl sm:max-w-2xl md:max-w-2xl\">\r\n        Create ad previews with fewer steps so you can focus on what you do best.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"max-w-md mx-auto mt-3 sm:flex sm:justify-center md:mt-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"rounded-full shadow\">\r\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-full px-8 py-3 text-base font-normal text-white bg-teal-400 border border-transparent rounded-full text-md hover:bg-teal-300 md:py-4 md:text-2xl md:px-10\">Start for free</button>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>"
